### Get order by id
GET {{orderBaseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}


### Get orders - first page
GET {{orderBaseUrl}}/orders?page=0&size=10


### Get orders - second page
GET {{orderBaseUrl}}/orders?page=1&size=10


### Get orders by customer
GET {{orderBaseUrl}}/orders?customerId={{customerId}}&page=0&size=10


### Invalid page - expect 400
GET {{orderBaseUrl}}/orders?page=-1&size=10


### Order not found - expect 404
GET {{orderBaseUrl}}/orders/99999999-9999-9999-9999-999999999999
